    "version": "0.1.0",
    "name": "LLM Call",
    "description": "Synchronous chat-completion call over HTTP. Builds an OpenAI-style chat body from prompt, system, and model, POSTs it to the url input, and returns the extracted reply, the full response, and the HTTP status. Credentials arrive only through the headers input, which the parent graph builds from its own secrets. This graph references no secrets. Each run sends the prompt to the endpoint and can incur provider cost.",
